ood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","review_id":"If4u5zhqBCD8fmrYSbqz2A","date":"2017-05-14T23:23:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9237200021743774,"text_excerpt":"This was an absolute gem hidden away in the Hyatt hotel. I stayed at the Hyatt so would come down here for a quick bite. I have tried their breakfast bowls and they are very delicious. The portion was huge and the price was right. Their soy lattes are pretty good as well. Also had lunch here one time and their oyster po boy was on point and super delicious. The best thing here are their beignets which are even better than cafe du monde. They were freshly made and I loved the strawberry compote that it was served with. I highly recommend this place, plus their service is super friendly!"},{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","review_id":"Q_HjgJJ0D-yO8Nx9NZx6QA","date":"2020-02-23T21:21:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9235948920249939,"text_excerpt":"I always plan my restaurants ahead when I travel, and this is one of the best breakfasts I've eaten! This is a very cute and clean cafe inside the Hyatt in the French Quarter. I wish I knew my server's name, but lost my receipt. She was so nice and brought me everything I needed. She even went back to check and make sure the pecan pancakes were gluten-free. You place your order at the counter. There are many GF options. She put my coffee in a to-go cup so I could take it when I left. Very good coffee. The place was decorated for Mardi Gras and was just very cute. There is plenty of seating and it's very comfortable. My food came out in good time, and I was so impressed. The side of scramb..."},{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","review_id":"h8788TfhE3v2_SXbjAvvJg","date":"2017-11-27T18:15:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9132007360458374,"text_excerpt":"Great service all weekend from the whole staff here! I'm told they don't usually have a buffet but they did this weekend (maybe for Bayou Classic?) which included the usual lineup of breakfast foods, coffee, and the best orange juice! Another day we ordered from the regular menu and had the oatmeal, a breakfast bowl, lox and bagel, and the pancakes. All were delish! There is also a small candy corner, coffee bar, and pastry selection if you're looking for food to go. Gotta admit, I shared a rock candy or two with the kiddos after a day of walking the city, a fun little treat on the way back to our room!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","photo_id":"bpzS0FXLEjxReBtdgplt6Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bpzS0FXLEjxReBtdgplt6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8911592364311218},{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","photo_id":"zohNYleZiR4p-LrN44sJ9Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zohNYleZiR4p-LrN44sJ9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8334325551986694},{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","photo_id":"6buU1gBdkPARgqQ-4dO_hQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6buU1gBdkPARgqQ-4dO_hQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8240823745727539},{"business_id":"FNsMxoaTa-HCbAxP0Baj9Q","photo_id":"oDWP0uyQtpCTsOYNQ1txLA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oDWP0uyQtpCTsOYNQ1txLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8011839389801025